#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.0.11.rst:4
msgid "v4.0.11"
msgstr "v4.0.11"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.0.11.rst:6
msgid ""
"v4.0.11 is a maintenance release that hardens the firmware-flashing tools "
"against concurrent operations and repairs the Windows installer's bundled "
"USB driver installation. It stays on Qt Creator 10.0.1 (the same base as the"
" previous release), and there are no breaking changes."
msgstr ""
"v4.0.11 est une version de maintenance qui renforce les outils de flashage "
"du micrologiciel contre les opérations concurrentes et répare l'installation"
" du pilote USB fourni avec le programme d'installation Windows. Elle reste "
"sur Qt Creator 10.0.1 (la même base que la version précédente), et il n'y a "
"aucun changement incompatible."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.0.11.rst:14
msgid "On this page"
msgstr "Sur cette page"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.0.11.rst:17
msgid "Highlights"
msgstr "Points forts"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.0.11.rst:19
msgid ""
"**Thread-safe flashing tools** — bootloader, DFU, firmware-download, and "
"device-enumeration operations are now guarded by real mutex locks, "
"preventing race conditions when triggered concurrently."
msgstr ""
"**Outils de flashage thread-safe** — les opérations de programme d'amorçage,"
" de DFU, de téléchargement du micrologiciel et d'énumération des "
"périphériques sont désormais protégées par de véritables verrous mutex, ce "
"qui évite les conditions de concurrence lorsqu'elles sont déclenchées "
"simultanément."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.0.11.rst:22
msgid ""
"**Windows USB drivers repaired** — the bundled ``.inf`` driver files, "
"previously corrupted by text line-ending normalization, are now fixed and "
"re-added, and GIGA/Mimsy driver files were added."
msgstr ""
"**Pilotes USB Windows réparés** — les fichiers de pilote ``.inf`` fournis, "
"auparavant corrompus par la normalisation des fins de ligne du texte, sont "
"désormais corrigés et réintégrés, et les fichiers de pilote GIGA/Mimsy ont "
"été ajoutés."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.0.11.rst:25
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**Arduino installer exit codes** — the Arduino driver install command now "
"accepts the correct installer exit codes (``{5, 1280}``)."
msgstr ""
"**Codes de sortie du programme d'installation Arduino** — la commande "
"d'installation du pilote Arduino accepte désormais les bons codes de sortie "
"du programme d'installation (``{5, 1280}``)."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.0.11.rst:29
msgid "Bug fixes"
msgstr "Corrections de bogues"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.0.11.rst:31
msgid ""
"The firmware-flashing tools (``bossac``, ``dfu-util``, ``imx``, "
"``picotool``, and ``myqserialportinfo``) now guard their work with real "
"``QMutex`` locks instead of plain busy-flag booleans, preventing race "
"conditions when bootloader, DFU, firmware-download, and device-enumeration "
"operations are triggered concurrently (`565576085 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/565576085>`__)."
msgstr ""
"Les outils de flashage du micrologiciel (``bossac``, ``dfu-util``, ``imx``, "
"``picotool`` et ``myqserialportinfo``) protègent désormais leur travail avec"
" de véritables verrous ``QMutex`` au lieu de simples drapeaux booléens "
"d'occupation, ce qui évite les conditions de concurrence lorsque les "
"opérations de programme d'amorçage, de DFU, de téléchargement du "
"micrologiciel et d'énumération des périphériques sont déclenchées "
"simultanément (`565576085 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/565576085>`__)."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.0.11.rst:39
msgid "Platform and tool support"
msgstr "Prise en charge des plateformes et des outils"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.0.11.rst:41
msgid "**Qt Creator base:** 10.0.1."
msgstr "**Base Qt Creator :** 10.0.1."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.0.11.rst:42
msgid ""
"The Windows installer's bundled USB driver installation was repaired. The "
"bundled ``.inf`` driver files were being corrupted by line-ending "
"normalization; a ``*.inf binary`` ``.gitattributes`` rule now keeps them "
"intact, and the fixed files were re-added: the ``ftdibus.inf`` and "
"``ftdiport.inf`` FTDI drivers (`67bed53b2 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/67bed53b2>`__), the ``openmv.inf`` and ``pybcdc.inf`` drivers"
" (`3c94eb8fe <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/3c94eb8fe>`__), "
"and the DfuSe ``STtube.inf`` files (`962d4f20d "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/962d4f20d>`__), along with new "
"GIGA and Mimsy driver ``.inf``/``.cat`` files (`4a3327ad0 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/4a3327ad0>`__)."
msgstr ""
"L'installation du pilote USB fourni avec le programme d'installation Windows"
" a été réparée. Les fichiers de pilote ``.inf`` fournis étaient corrompus "
"par la normalisation des fins de ligne ; une règle ``.gitattributes`` "
"``*.inf binary`` les conserve désormais intacts, et les fichiers corrigés "
"ont été réintégrés : les pilotes FTDI ``ftdibus.inf`` et ``ftdiport.inf`` "
"(`67bed53b2 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/67bed53b2>`__), les"
" pilotes ``openmv.inf`` et ``pybcdc.inf`` (`3c94eb8fe "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/3c94eb8fe>`__), et les fichiers"
" DfuSe ``STtube.inf`` (`962d4f20d <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/962d4f20d>`__), ainsi que de nouveaux fichiers de pilote "
"``.inf``/``.cat`` GIGA et Mimsy (`4a3327ad0 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/4a3327ad0>`__)."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.0.11.rst:54
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The Arduino driver install command now accepts the correct installer exit "
"codes (``{5, 1280}``) (`4a3327ad0 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/4a3327ad0>`__)."
msgstr ""
"La commande d'installation du pilote Arduino accepte désormais les bons "
"codes de sortie du programme d'installation (``{5, 1280}``) (`4a3327ad0 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/4a3327ad0>`__)."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.0.11.rst:57
msgid ""
"The Windows code-signing step now skips the bundled third-party driver "
"installers (``dpinst*``/``vcredist*``) so they are not re-signed and "
"continue to work (`6cf14f7e1 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/6cf14f7e1>`__)."
msgstr ""
"L'étape de signature de code Windows ignore désormais les programmes "
"d'installation de pilotes tiers fournis (``dpinst*``/``vcredist*``) afin "
"qu'ils ne soient pas resignés et continuent de fonctionner (`6cf14f7e1 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/6cf14f7e1>`__)."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.0.11.rst:63
msgid "Breaking changes"
msgstr "Changements incompatibles"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.0.11.rst:65
msgid "None. Existing projects and workflows continue to work unchanged."
msgstr ""
"Aucun. Les projets et les flux de travail existants continuent de "
"fonctionner sans modification."
